# Implementation Plan: 11 11 Luxury Fashion E-Commerce Platform (Pragmatic & Scalable Architecture)

This implementation plan incorporates the lean architectural decisions: **avoid premature infrastructure complexity**, minimize operating overhead, guarantee relational integrity with PostgreSQL, and structure the system cleanly so technologies like Kafka or OpenSearch can be plugged in later without code rewrites.

---

## Architectural Principles & Decisions

| Layer | Selected Technology | Rationale & Trade-offs |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Storefront** | Next.js 14+ (App Router) + React + TypeScript | Hybrid rendering (ISR for PDP/PLP/Editorial; CSR for Cart, Checkout, Wishlist; SSR for Search) |
| **Admin Portal** | Next.js 14+ + React + TypeScript | Operational dashboard for inventory, catalog matrix, order fulfillment, and promotions |
| **Backend API** | Node.js + NestJS + TypeScript | **Modular Monolith** with clean boundaries (`catalog`, `inventory`, `orders`, `cart`, `payments`, etc.) |
| **Worker Service** | NestJS + BullMQ | Dedicated background queue consumer (`email`, `invoice`, `inventory.cleanup`, `notifications`) |
| **Database & ORM** | PostgreSQL 16 + Prisma ORM | Relational consistency, atomic row-level locking for inventory reservations, ACID transactions |
| **Cache & Queues** | Redis 7 + BullMQ | Ephemeral cart state, rate limiting, session store, BullMQ job queues (no Kafka overhead initially) |
| **Search Engine** | PostgreSQL Full-Text Search (via `SearchService` abstraction) | Fast GIN indexes on `name`, `sku`, `category`, `color`, `material` — swappable with OpenSearch later |
| **Object Storage** | DigitalOcean Spaces (S3-compatible API) | Offloads heavy luxury imagery, lookbooks, and invoices via `@aws-sdk/client-s3` with CDN |
| **Edge / CDN** | Cloudflare Free | DNS, SSL termination, DDoS protection, static caching |
| **Deployment** | Docker & Docker Compose on 1 DigitalOcean Droplet | Zero Kubernetes overhead initially; predictable cost; reproducible local & production environments |

