## Detailed Data Model (PostgreSQL via Prisma)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    User ||--o{ Address : has
    User ||--o{ Order : places
    User ||--o{ Cart : owns
    User ||--o{ Review : writes
    User ||--o{ WishlistItem : saves

    Category ||--o{ Product : contains
    Collection ||--o{ Product : groups
    Product ||--o{ ProductVariant : has
    Product ||--o{ ProductImage : displays
    ProductVariant ||--o{ InventoryItem : stocked_in
    ProductVariant ||--o{ InventoryReservation : reserved_by
    ProductVariant ||--o{ CartItem : added_to
    ProductVariant ||--o{ OrderItem : purchased_in

    Order ||--o{ OrderItem : contains
    Order ||--o{ OrderStatusHistory : tracks
    Order ||--o{ Payment : records
    Order ||--o{ Shipment : fulfills
    Coupon ||--o{ Order : discounts
```

### Key Schema Highlights
1. **Fashion Variant Model**:
   - `Product`: Brand, title, slug, description, material, care instructions, base category, collection.
   - `ProductVariant`: SKU (`1111-DRS-BLK-S`), size (`S, M, L, XL`), color name & hex, price, compareAtPrice (MSRP), barcode.
   - `ProductImage`: URL (Spaces CDN), storageKey, altText, sortOrder, isPrimary.
2. **Inventory & Reservation System**:
   - `InventoryItem`: `variantId`, `warehouseId`, `quantityOnHand`, `reservedQuantity`.
   - `InventoryReservation`: `id`, `variantId`, `cartId`, `quantity`, `expiresAt` (15-min lock), `status` (`ACTIVE`, `FULFILLED`, `RELEASED`).
   - Atomic reservation logic using PostgreSQL transaction row locking (`SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`) prevents overselling.
3. **Cart & Orders**:
   - `Cart` & `CartItem`: Works for guest sessions (via anonymous cookie token) and authenticated users (merged upon login).
   - `Order`: Order number (`1111-ORD-XXXX`), subtotal, discount, tax, shippingFee, totalAmount, currency, status (`PENDING_PAYMENT`, `PAID`, `PROCESSING`, `SHIPPED`, `DELIVERED`, `CANCELLED`).
   - `Payment`: Gateway transaction ID, gateway (`RAZORPAY` / `CASHFREE`), status (`INITIATED`, `CAPTURED`, `FAILED`, `REFUNDED`), raw webhook payload.

