   - Selects Size M / Onyx Black -> Adds to cart (reserves stock for 15 mins).
   - Applies coupon `WELCOME11` -> Sees instant price deduction.
   - Enters shipping address -> Completes simulated payment -> Receives Order Confirmation with order ID.
